  "title": "Cockroach Janta Party Leaders Arrested Amid Delhi Protests",
  "summary": "Delhi Police arrested Cockroach Janta Party (CJP) leaders Saurav Das, Ashutosh Ranka, and Ajinkya Shinde for trespassing into the Jantar Mantar protest site, following a rally in the area. The protesters, a group linked to the CJP, demanded the resignation of Chief Election Commissioner Gyanesh Kumar, citing security and political issues.",
